+// Hazardous surfaces. Lava shipped with a damage slot nobody filled in, so it
+// has always been a surface you drive across; these turn it back into a
+// hazard. It changes the race simulation, so K_HazardRulesActive stands both
+// of them down in netgames and replays no matter what is saved here.
+// Tricks are armed by a tic with accelerate released, which nobody who simply
+// holds accelerate ever produces - so without this, a trick panel is followed
+// by a flick that does nothing. The assist writes that tic into the ticcmd
+// like any other input, so it stays netgame- and replay-safe.
+// How tightly the kart holds its line. 50 is stock; higher grips the road,
+// lower lets the back end slide. Applied to the kart's base friction.
+consvar_t cv_handling = Player("handling", "100").min_max(0, 100).save();
+
+// The same lever, but only while drifting. Defaults to full hold: a drift
+// that slides as far as the stock one does reads as losing the car.
+consvar_t cv_drifthandling = Player("drifthandling", "100").min_max(0, 100).save();
+
+// Hit gas just as you touch down from a respawn for a boost bigger than the
+// Drop Dash pays - the harder input, the better payout.
+consvar_t cv_landingdash = Player("landingdash", "On").on_off().save();
+
+// Buttons Only: the drift button fires the trick and the stick only aims it,
